<title>USA: MBIA qualifies six municipal bond issues.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies six municipal bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA on Tuesday said it qualified the following six municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale:</p>
<p>--Gilbert, Ariz., $5.335 milion revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Ascension Parish, Louisiana, School District, General Obligations (GOs), $10 million.</p>
<p>--Robert A. Reid, Mich., $5.555 million drainage bonds.</p>
<p>--Mound View ISD, Minn, $1.030 million GOS Cap Fac.</p>
<p>--Pipestone, Minn., $2.465 million GO improvement.</p>
<p>--Orem, Utah, $6 million road and bridge GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
